,"received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MLoughry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-04-26T21:40:47Z","updated_at":"2018-04-26T21:40:47Z","body":"It may make sense for webpack to offload this work in the case where the HTML page is generated at the same time. \r\n\r\nHowever, in our case, we just upload the output to a version directory on a CDN, and a server page just takes in a version parameter and serves the scripts from there. We *could* modify the build to upload the manifest of entry-child chunks, and have the server page make an additional request to the CDN for said manifest and add the prefetch links; but it seems simpler to simply have webpack handle that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/384797706/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"MLoughry","id":20823465,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwODIzNDY1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/20823465?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MLoughry","html_url":"https://github.com/MLoughry","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MLoughry/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MLoughry/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MLoughry/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MLoughry/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MLoughry/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MLoughry/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MLoughry/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MLoughry/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MLoughry/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/385260414","html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/7084#issuecomment-385260414","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/7084","id":385260414,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM4NTI2MDQxNA==","user":{"login":"satazor","id":1017236,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTcyMzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1017236?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/satazor","html_url":"https://github.com/satazor","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satazor/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satazor/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satazor/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satazor/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satazor/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satazor/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satazor/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satazor/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/satazor/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-04-29T15:44:26Z","updated_at":"2018-04-29T15:45:30Z","body":"From what I understood, webpack doesn't prefetch/preload chunks that are direct children of entrypoints. It seems that it assumes that developers are using `html-webpack-plugin` with `resource-hints-webpack-plugin` or similar.\r\n\r\nAnyway, I think it would be useful to have some option to change the behavior to prefetch the direct children as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/385260414/reactions","total_count":16,"+1":15,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"satazor","id":1017236,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTcyMzY=","avat